      "text": "About"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "html": "<p>We created a game similar to “Papers, Please”. We wanted there to be more interaction by having the player swivel in a chair to each different workstation. We wanted to create an atmosphere that was eerie and made the player constantly second-guess their choices.</p>"
    },
